 going into it. Felt good to check off each part of the workout. I think this is a good methodology for progress, just NEED to be consistent about it. Workout took 70 minutes total. Test.","runDone":false,"_lastSet":1781873919685,"stretches":{"0":true,"1":true,"2":true},"_sessionStart":1781829215211},"1":{"done":true,"feel":"OK","sets":{"0-0":{"done":true},"0-1":{"done":true},"1-0":{"done":true},"1-1":{"done":true},"2-0":{"done":true},"2-1":{"done":true},"3-0":{"done":true},"3-1":{"done":true}},"subs":{},"extra":[],"_ended":null,"custom":[],"fields":{"Time":"40:00","Avg HR":"157","Distance (mi)":"4.62"},"warmup":{"0":true,"1":true,"2":true,"3":true,"4":true},"journal":"I would like for each running day to include a warmup, like stretching and mobility then also be a bit more detailed of a workout rather than just easy have a bit more of a breakdown of what it looks like. Then some stretching at the end as well with a quick 5-10 minute budyweight strength and core workout. I would like running days to have an overall similar structure to the strength days in that regard where the workouts also collapse once completed. also having a Journal attached to the weight tab would be very nice for example last night I ate a bit more and had 2 drinks since a friend was in town so my weight was up and also definitely affected my performance this morning. Feeling very sore from yesterdays legs workout.","runDone":true,"_lastSet":1781829336074,"stretches":{"0":true,"1":true,"2":true,"3":true},"_sessionStart":1781657010482},"2":{"done":false,"feel":"Good","sets":{"0-0":{"w":"135","done":true},"0-1":{"w":"155","done":true},"0-2":{"w":"165","done":true},"0-3":{"w":"175","done":true},"0-w":{"w":"45","done":true},"1-0":{"w":"95","done":true},"1-1":{"w":"105","done":true},"1-2":{"w":"105","done":true},"1-w":{"w":"45","done":true,"rest":11},"2-0":{"w":"95","done":true},"2-1":{"w":"115","done":true},"2-2":{"w":"125","done":true},"2-3":{"w":"135","done":true},"2-w":{"w":"45","done":true,"